                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is a healthy Amazon ACOS?</h3>
                                        <p>15-30% for scaling brands. 10-20% for optimised brands. Category-dependent.</p>
                                        <h3>Should I be on all marketplaces?</h3>
                                        <p>Depends on category. Fashion: Myntra + Ajio + Amazon Fashion. Beauty: Nykaa + Amazon + Flipkart. Electronics: Amazon + Flipkart primary. Reserve premium collections for brand.com.</p>
